### Page 1 of 1

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:    Mayor Richard L. Kaysen and City Council
FROM:  Rudy T. Apodaca
DATE:  July 9, 2014
SUBJECT:
Consideration of  Bid  #R-28-14  for furnishing 65 Gallon
and 95 gallon Automated Refuse Containers to the City of
Cheyenne Sanitation Division.
Three (3) bids were received. The bids were reviewed by Dennis Pino

and his recommendation is to  accept the low bid of Otto
Environmental System, of Charlotte, NC. for items 1,2,3,4, and 5
for a bid amount of $69,414.00 and to accept the bid for items  6
and 7 for the containers with Gravity Locks to Rehrig Pacific of
Los Angeles, CA. for a bid amount of $16,842.00, for a total bid
amount of $86,256.00. There were two  lower bid for items 6 & 7 but
they did not meet the minimum specifications set forth by the using
department.
Funding is from Impact assistance (001-21-2113-40-43418).
```
